sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Viewer as Browser
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant CF as CloudFront
    participant S3 as S3 Processed

    Viewer->>API: GET /videos/:id/<br/>playback-auth
    API->>DB: Read video
    API->>API: Access rule:<br/>visibility, moderation
    alt Not allowed
        API-->>Viewer: 404 private,<br/>403 removed
    else Allowed
        API->>API: Sign policy<br/>videos/{id}/*, 2 h
        API-->>Viewer: 3 CloudFront cookies,<br/>Path=/videos/{id}/
    end

    Viewer->>CF: GET master.m3u8<br/>with cookies
    CF->>CF: Verify signature,<br/>trusted key group
    alt Valid cookie
        CF->>S3: Cache miss:<br/>GET via OAC
        S3-->>CF: Playlist
        CF-->>Viewer: 200 playlist
        loop Every segment
            Viewer->>CF: GET segment
            CF-->>Viewer: 200 segment
        end
    else Missing or expired
        CF-->>Viewer: 403 at the edge
        Note over Viewer,API: Player asks for new<br/>cookies, reloads source
    end
